<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A GetDividends response for one company, recorded from the live service and
  trimmed to three of the twenty-five entries it returned.

  The first is as BVB sent it, and shows two things the mapping depends on: an
  unreported value arrives as an empty element carrying xsi:nil rather than
  being omitted, and GMS_Date is the one element the service spells with an
  underscore.

  The second and third are added, because the recorded response happened not to
  contain either and both have to survive the mapping: a dividend announced with
  nothing settled yet, and one where a value arrived in a form that cannot be
  read. Neither may cost the other its import.
-->
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
               xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
               xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
